msgctxt "92"
msgid "So those renovators were a couple of scam artists after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey there. Did you ever find that construction company you were looking "
"for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I sure did. In fact, they swindled me out of my money with some phony "
"renovations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "But I heard their president was just arrested by the police."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Arrested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Apparently some of their workers were in the hospital with some injuries, "
"and they were identified by law enforcement there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I see. Will you be getting your money back, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Well, the police said they'll get my money back for me, so I can rest well "
"in my old age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"But I'd sure like to shake the person's hand who smashed up those blasted "
"renovation workers and sent 'em to the hospital! Hehe..."
msgstr ""

